{"description":"## Scope
Extract the left WBS panel into composable focused components.

## Files to Create
- src/components/wbs/WBSPanel.tsx — Container; receives filter state and tree data, composes children
- src/components/wbs/WBSFilters.tsx — Search input, hideClosed toggle, closedTimeFilter dropdown, includeHierarchy toggle
- src/components/wbs/WBSHeader.tsx — Panel title, expand/collapse all buttons, sort controls, bead count
- src/components/wbs/FavoritesSection.tsx — Favorite beads horizontal strip (currently inline in main render)

## Key Props for WBSPanel
```typescript
interface WBSPanelProps {
  // Filter state (from useFilterState hook)
  filterText: string;
  onFilterTextChange: (v: string) => void;
  hideClosed: boolean;
  onHideClosedChange: (v: boolean) => void;
  closedTimeFilter: ClosedTimeFilter;
  onClosedTimeFilterChange: (v: ClosedTimeFilter) => void;
  includeHierarchy: boolean;
  onIncludeHierarchyChange: (v: boolean) => void;
  sortBy: SortBy;
  sortOrder: SortOrder;
  onHeaderClick: (col: SortBy) => void;
  // Tree data
  beads: BeadNode[];
  collapsedIds: Set<string>;
  onToggleNode: (id: string) => void;
  onExpandAll: () => void;
  onCollapseAll: () => void;
  // Bead selection
  selectedBead: BeadNode | null;
  onBeadClick: (bead: BeadNode) => void;
  onOpenChat: (bead: BeadNode) => void;
  // Sessions
  sessionsByBead: Record<string, string[]>;
  // Scroll
  scrollRef: React.RefObject<HTMLDivElement>;
  // Loading
  loading: boolean;
  processingData: boolean;
}
```

## Success Criteria
- WBSPanel composes WBSFilters + WBSHeader + WBSTreeList + FavoritesSection
- No layout changes visible to user
- All props are well-typed
- Sub-components are independently testable"}

{"description":"## Scope
Extract the right Gantt panel into focused components.

## Files to Create
- src/components/gantt/GanttPanel.tsx — Container; receives layout data + scroll refs, composes grid/bars/connectors
- src/components/gantt/GanttGrid.tsx — Background column grid (50 col divs, zoom-aware)
- src/components/gantt/GanttConnectors.tsx — SVG dependency connector layer (paths computed by useGanttLayout)
- src/components/gantt/GanttBars.tsx — Bar rendering layer (uses existing GanttBar component per row)

## Key Props for GanttPanel
```typescript
interface GanttPanelProps {
  // Layout data (from useGanttLayout hook)
  items: GanttItem[];
  rowCount: number;
  connectors: Connector[];
  ganttGridColumns: React.ReactNode;
  // Zoom
  zoom: number;
  onZoomChange: (z: number) => void;
  // Bead interaction
  selectedBead: BeadNode | null;
  onBeadClick: (bead: BeadNode) => void;
  onOpenChat: (bead: BeadNode) => void;
  // Sessions
  sessionsByBead: Record<string, string[]>;
  // Scroll sync
  scrollRef: React.RefObject<HTMLDivElement>;
  headerScrollRef: React.RefObject<HTMLDivElement>;
  onScroll: (e: React.UIEvent) => void;
  // State header
  ganttStateHeader: GanttStateHeader props...
}
```

## Notes
- GanttStateHeader component already exists — GanttPanel just wires it
- GanttConnectors renders SVG overlay positioned absolutely over GanttBars
- Scroll sync refs (ganttScrollRef, ganttHeaderScrollRef) passed in from useScrollSync

## Success Criteria
- Gantt rendering logic componentized with clear data flow
- Scroll sync refs correctly threaded through
- SVG connector overlay z-index and positioning preserved
- Performance unchanged (no new re-render sources)"}

{"description":"## Scope
After all extractions complete, create MainAppView that composes all extracted pieces into the main render path.

## Files to Create
- src/views/MainAppView.tsx

## Responsibility
Receives all hook outputs from App.tsx and renders the correct view based on 'view' state:
- No project → ProjectSelectionView (bp6-r5dt.1)
- settings → SettingsView
- terminal → Terminal (with projectShellKey for remounting)
- sessions → SessionsView
- gantt → WBSPanel + GanttPanel (the main split-pane view)
- list → WBSPanel + ListView

## What Stays in App.tsx After This Task
```typescript
export function App() {
  // All custom hooks (9-10 lines each)
  const init = useAppInitialization();
  const project = useProjectState(init);
  const filters = useFilterState(project, init);
  const ganttTree = useGanttTree(filters.viewModel);
  const ganttLayout = useGanttLayout(filters.viewModel, ganttTree.zoom, ganttTree.collapsedIds);
  const beadEditing = useBeadEditing(project.loadData);
  const chatSessions = useChatSessions();
  const ui = usePersistentUI();
  const scroll = useScrollSync(filters.loading);

  // Routing: session window vs main app (~5 lines)
  if (isSessionWindow && sessionId) {
    return <SessionWindowView sessionId={sessionId} ... />;
  }

  return (
    <Providers ...>
      <MainAppView ... />
    </Providers>
  );
}
```
Target: App.tsx < 150 lines.

## Success Criteria
- App.tsx reduced to routing + hook wiring only (< 150 lines)
- MainAppView handles all view switching
- All context providers wrap at the right level
- No functional regressions
- Passes: tsc, cargo check, manual smoke test of all views"}

{"description":"## Scope
